 ],
 "answer_text": "Found 1 gene record for BRCA1: BRCA1 DNA repair associated [12]. \n\nIts protein participates in transcription, DNA repair of double-stranded breaks, and recombination, and mutations in this gene are responsible for approximately 40% of inherited breast cancers and more than 80% of inherited breast and ovarian cancers [1]. \n\nDNA repair function\n\nThe BRCA1-BARD1 complex functions in DNA end resection and DNA protection [2]. HRDetect has been developed as a predictor of BRCA1 and BRCA2 deficiency based on mutational signatures [3]. BRCA1-deficient cancer cells can be sensitized to PARP inhibitors by targeting GPX4-mediated ferroptosis protection [4]. \n\nMutations in BRCA1 are linked to inherited breast and ovarian cancers [1]. \n\nClinVar records include NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.5243_5277+2788del [5], NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.5277+2916_5277+2946delinsGG [6], NG_005905.2:g.(147057_150288)_(160933_166866)del [7], GRCh37/hg19 17q21.31(chr17:41267743-41267796)x3 [8], and NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.2145C>G (p.Thr715=) [9]. BRCA1 also functions as an endocrine and metabolic regulator [10], and preneoplastic stromal cells promote BRCA1-mediated breast tumorigenesis [11]. \n\nGene records found\n\nGene NCBIGene:672, name: BRCA1 DNA repair associated [12]. Gene symbol: BRCA1 [13]. \n\nPubmed records found\n\nPubmed title: HRDetect is a predictor of BRCA1 and BRCA2 deficiency based on mutational signatures [3]. Pubmed title: BRCA1: An Endocrine and Metabolic Regulator [10]. Pubmed title: Preneoplastic stromal cells promote BRCA1-mediated breast tumorigenesis [11]. Pubmed title: Mechanism of BRCA1-BARD1 function in DNA end resection and DNA protection [2]. Pubmed title: Targeting GPX4-mediated ferroptosis protection sensitizes BRCA1-deficient cancer cells to PARP inhibitors [4]. \n\nClinvar records found\n\nClinvar title: NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.5243_5277+2788del [5]. Clinvar title: NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.5277+2916_5277+2946delinsGG [6]. Clinvar title: NG_005905.2:g.(147057_150288)_(160933_166866)del [7]. Clinvar title: GRCh37/hg19 17q21.31(chr17:41267743-41267796)x3 [8]. Clinvar title: NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.2145C>G (p.Thr715=) [9]. \n\nOmim records found\n\nBRCA1 DNA REPAIR-ASSOCIATED PROTEIN [14]. BRCA1 [14]. \n\nClinical trial records found\n\nClinical trial name: Germline BRCA1 and BRCA2 Mutations in Jewish Women Affected by Breast Cancer [15]. Clinical trial name: BRCA1 Haploinsufficiency and Gene Expression [16]. Clinical trial name: Study to Evaluate Treatment Customized According to RAP80 and BRCA1 in Patients With Advanced Lung Carcinoma [17]. Clinical trial name: Letrozole in Preventing Breast Cancer in Postmenopausal Women With a BRCA1 or BRCA2 Mutation [18]. Clinical trial name: Recombinant Human Chorionic Gonadotropin in Preventing Breast Cancer in Premenopausal Women With BRCA1 Mutations [19]. "
